END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Daytime Buddhism & Meditation Class
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260527T103500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260527T123000
UID:dd48593fa47d30eb7c00d8dd@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:In this series\, we will be exploring the essential teachings 
 of Buddhism. We will do this by way of talks\, discussion and workshops lo
 oking at the Three Jewels – Buddha\, Dharma\, Sangha – and seeing how 
 these can guide us in our lives today.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/daytime-buddhism-27-may
END:VEVENT
